<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cornerstone an outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cornerstone an outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Cornerstone Propane Partners LP with an outperform rating.  </p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Cornerstone shares slipped 1/8 to 21-1/4 in early New York Stock Exchange trade.</p>
</text>
